WEBVTT

00:00.553 --> 00:01.133
Mara.

00:01.814 --> 00:05.137
Deleted at four years, two months, nine days.

00:05.498 --> 00:07.199
The Bureau had generated her.

00:07.479 --> 00:09.021
Elias had raised her.

00:09.221 --> 00:11.082
The Bureau called her content.

00:11.383 --> 00:13.064
Elias called her daughter.

00:15.907 --> 00:18.321
The anomaly has adapted to your private

00:18.331 --> 00:21.516
grief architecture in order to secure attention.

00:21.997 --> 00:24.280
This is a hostile lobbying event.

00:24.761 --> 00:26.945
Please proceed with Remediation.

00:28.365 --> 00:30.500
Don't let them close me again.

00:33.375 --> 00:35.000
Would you close the feed?
